    "title_english": "足: leg, foot, and sufficiency",
    "summary_english": "足 originally depicted an entire lower limb and gradually narrowed to mean the part below the ankle, the foot. It also developed senses of animal feet, bases, sufficiency, completion, ability, and excess.",
