    "title_english": "省: inspection, reflection, and the history of 眚",
    "summary_english": "省 began as a character with 目 and a reduced 生 phonetic and originally meant to inspect. Its graphic history is closely bound to 眚, and its later readings distinguish inspection and self-examination from administrative, territorial, and economizing senses.",
