    "title_english": "才: sprouting growth, capacity, and recentness",
    "summary_english": "才 is an indicative character showing vegetation emerging from the ground. Its original meaning is the first growth of plants, which led to material endowment, ability, talented people, and the adverbial senses ‘just now’ and ‘only.’",
